(footprint "Minlenda_MLD-SMA-KE-H13.5-1.6_EdgeMount" (version 20241229) (generator "pcbnew") (generator_version "9.0") (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Minlenda MLD-SMA-KE-H13.5-1.6 SMA female edge-clamp jack for a 1.6 mm board (LCSC C52766461). Datasheet MLD-2509031032 recommended layout: 3 top pads 1.25 x 4.2 mm, outer pad centres 5.65 mm apart; ground legs straddle the board, centre pin on top. The front view puts the ground legs at +/-2.55 mm (standard 5.1 mm SMA pattern), so the ground pads here are widened to 1.5 mm and centred at +/-2.70 mm to cover both readings. Pads start at the board edge (Dwgs.User line). Check a real part before ordering PCBs.")
  (tags "SMA edge mount end launch clamp 1.6mm Minlenda SMA-KE")
